From f853bcc1d9c64f400493f46df1c94c480533a2ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matze <hartmannmathias57@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:22:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional GGML CUDA backend and persistent
 kmd-encode-serve

KIMODO_ENABLE_CUDA=ON builds ggml-cuda; at runtime CUDA is tried before
Vulkan (KIMODO_BACKEND=cuda|vulkan|cpu picks one). kmd-encode-serve keeps the
text encoder loaded and answers length-prefixed prompts on stdin/stdout.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
